y can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Jerry%27s_Junk\" title=\"Jerry&#39;s Junk\">Jerry's Junk</a> shop beside the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a> for 6,700$ each.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903044413\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019521/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.234      1 Template:Schematics\n100.00%   32.234      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3719-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903044413 and revision id 20589. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Jerry's Junk","exists":true},{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true}],"images":["Storage_MicroDrawer.png","Storage_Drawer_Schematic.png"]}
